---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the CIESIN Map Archive">
  <div class="container section">
    <h1 class="section-title">About the CIESIN Map Archive</h1>

    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        The <strong>CIESIN Map Archive</strong> is a searchable digital archive of high-resolution static maps
        authored and maintained by the <a href="https://www.ciesin.columbia.edu/">Center for International
        Earth Science Information Network (CIESIN)</a> at Columbia University.
      </p>

      <h2>STAC</h2>
      <p>
        All maps in this archive are catalogued using the
        <a href="https://stacspec.org/">SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog (STAC)</a> specification,
        enabling interoperability with the broader geospatial data ecosystem. Each map is a
        STAC Item with standardized metadata including spatial extent, date of production, and
        operational use case.
      </p>

      <h2>Collections</h2>
      <p>
        Maps are organized into thematic collections and can be browsed by administrative areas of interest, or searched by keyword, location, and
        date range.
      </p>
      <p>
        <em>
        This archive is a work in progress; Version 1.0 includes a limited set of maps of the Democratic Republic of the Congo produced between late 2024 and early 2026 as part of the GRID3 project's collaboration with Gavi, the Vaccine Alliance's Equity Accelerator Fund (EAF).
        </em>
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
